252: ## 6. Queuing Asynchronous Data Jobs
253: 
254: To perform off-loop network calls (like an HTTP POST/PUT triggered by a web portal action), enqueue a job on `DataManager`:
255: 
256: ```cpp
257: void MyModule::onConfigSaved() {
258:     app.getDataManager().queueDataJob([this](const FetchContext& ctx) {
259: #ifdef ESP_PLATFORM
260:         if (!ctx.client) return;
261:         HTTPClient http;
262:         if (http.begin(*ctx.client, "https://hub.local/api/setpoint")) {
263:             http.addHeader("Content-Type", "application/json");
264:             http.POST("{\"temp\": 22}");
265:             http.end();
266:         }
267: #endif
268:     }, "setTemperature");
269: }
270: ```
